  "title": "NOV Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, June 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NOV Inc. (NYSE: NOV) will hold a conference call to discuss its second quarter 2026 results on Wednesday, July 29, 2026, at 10 a.m. (Central Time). NOV will issue a press release with the Company’s results after the market closes for trading on Tuesday,",
